{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1335859-focused-mage-sight-and-the-ring-from-reign-of-the-exarchs-spoilers","id":1335859,"title":"Focused Mage Sight and the Ring from Reign of the Exarchs (Spoilers)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-15T03:46:23-07:00","id":1335859,"title":"Focused Mage Sight and the Ring from Reign of the Exarchs (Spoilers)","content":"I am trying to understand how Focused Mage Sight might work in practice. So if someone were to use focused mage sight on the Ring, what would be revealed?<br /> <br /> As a secondary question, does the new rules for Focused Mage Sight &quot;ruin&quot; the chronicle? I haven't ever read the entire book back to front so I don't know if the Chronicle hinges on the players not knowing certain things at any point (I hope not) but it seems like the players might discover quite a lot simply because the Ring came into their possession. What could the mages reasonably discover through Mage Sight?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T07:23:27-07:00","id":1335885,"title":"","content":"Whats the ring do again? It shows strands like puppet strings on things the Exarchs are influencing or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"dat